  <item>
    <title>vol.31请回答，中女们！一边信命一边自强的生活吧～</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68fc6ee2083a71a4eb2bd107</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68fc6ee2083a71a4eb2bd107</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 26 Oct 2025 14:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期播客是三位中女围坐一起的一次漫谈。仅代表个人立场。</span><br><span></span><br><span>此播客仍在主播偏见中产生。不作任何引导，反对网暴。若您在收听过程中感到不适，可以去听点别的。</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：丸子，颗粒</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：雅雅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="34">00:34</a> 三十多岁的你们信命了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="152">02:32</a> 你后悔吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="194">03:14</a> 少年心气是否是不可再生之物？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="602">10:02</a>玄学给予我们的生存智慧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="819">13:39</a> 未来想要完成……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="885">14:45</a> 寿命是随机的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1021">17:01</a> 你成为了你小时候想象中的大人吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1080">18:00</a> 对自己满意就是成功</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1258">20:58</a> 如果人生失败，请靠精神胜利法撑下去</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1338">22:18</a> 进入中女时代的一些明显改变</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1518">25:18</a> 我们只能是搭子不会是朋友</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1710">28:30</a> 不再做“老好人”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2048">34:08</a> 对待爸妈态度的转变</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2139">35:39</a> 爸妈也在进步</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2182">36:22</a> 为“孤独终老”做心理建设</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2500">41:40</a> 接受“友情”在人生舞台中淡出</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2687">44:47</a>看到真正健康的人“正常人”会产生怀疑和自卑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3080">51:20</a> 没有多余能量的时候，拒绝再为他人提供解决方案和情绪价值</span></p>]]></description>
